{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":4742498,"ns":0,"title":"Downstream (manufacturing)","extract":"Downstream, in manufacturing, refers to processes which occur later on in a production sequence or production line.\nViewing a company \"from order to cash\" might have high-level processes such as marketing, sales, order entry, manufacturing, packaging, shipping, and invoicing.","description":"Term in manufacturing","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}